      "model": "book",
      "codex": "st_andrals_register",
      "text": "The register of St. Andral's, in Father Lucian's careful hand. Baptisms, few. Burials, many. A note on the inside cover: The saint lies below in the oak box in the sarcophagus; the gravedigger and I alone know the way of the lid. If I am taken, Milivoj will show my successor. Under it, a later line, pressed hard: May God forgive me for trusting a hungry boy."
